OL,3,AMiley Cyrus pays tribute to godmother
OL,4,ADolly Parton - now 'an angel by my
OL,5,Aside'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMiley Cyrus, Taylor Swift, Beyonce, Sir
OL,8,FPaul McCartney and Sir Elton John have
OL,9,Fled an outpouring of tributes from
OL,10,Fcelebrities and fans to Dolly Parton
OL,11,Ffollowing the music icon's death at the
OL,12,Fage of 80.
OL,14,FCyrus paid an emotional tribute to her
OL,15,Fgodmother, "Aunt Dolly", describing her
OL,16,Fas an "angel by my side". "I will
OL,17,Falways love her and want to make her
OL,18,Fproud," she wrote on Instagram.
OL,20,FThe Tennessee-born singer died on
OL,21,FTuesday after "a brief battle with
OL,22,Fcancer", her team said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
