OL,3,AMiley Cyrus pays tribute to godmother
OL,4,ADolly Parton - now 'an angel by my
OL,5,Aside'
OL,6,
OL,7,FParton is known for iconic songs
OL,8,Fincluding Jolene, 9 to 5 and I Will
OL,9,FAlways Love You. She was also a
OL,10,Fphilanthropist, who helped fund one of
OL,11,Fthe first Covid-19 vaccines and poured
OL,12,Fmillions into improving children's
OL,13,Fliteracy.
